=head1 DESCRIPTION

A property change that was cancelled for an Amazon OpenSearch Service
domain.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 ActiveValue => Str

The current value of the property, after the change was cancelled.


=head2 CancelledValue => Str

The pending value of the property that was cancelled. This would have
been the eventual value of the property if the chance had not been
cancelled.


=head2 PropertyName => Str

The name of the property whose change was cancelled.



